# 🌎 washington-lulc-ml-landsat.git

Sharing scripts created in UCLA MAGIST's GEOG 415: Geospatial Data Science Futures. Collaborative final project: ML LULC classification for Eastern Washington with my classmates.

Setting up GitHub mirror: 

```
git clone https://earthengine.googlesource.com/users/leependu/washington-lulc-ml-landsat
git remote add github git@github.com:leependu/washington-lulc-ml-landsat.git
git config remote.github.push refs/heads/master:refs/heads/main
```